  "title": "Chicken Cacciatore Sandwich",
  "description": "Leftover shredded chicken is mixed with a briny tomato and mushroom sauce and heaped onto toasted hoagie rolls with melted provolone in these easy chicken cacciatore sandwiches.",
  "authors": [
    "Mark Stroginis"
  ],
